[[Next->Q5]]


:: F5 {"position":"25,150","size":"100,100"}
Model answer: B: ADP + Pi

ATP hydrolysis typically yields ADP and inorganic phosphate (Pi), releasing free energy that cells can couple to other processes. The alternative options either omit phosphate chemistry or describe products that are not formed in the standard ATP hydrolysis reaction.

